# This mod ships no assembly and has nothing to build. The entry that earns its place here is
# .claude/: a session worktree is a full copy of the monorepo this folder came out of, hundreds
# of megabytes, and a session creates it in whatever folder it is working in.
#
# Steam does not read .gitignore at all. SteamUGC.SetItemContent takes the junction's target
# directory as it stands on disk, with no filtering, so anything sitting in the published folder
# is published. That is what Mod/ is for: the junction points there, and everything else in this
# folder - Art/, the docs, this file - stays out of reach by construction.

# Claude Code session worktrees and their local settings.
.claude/

# Showcase source images: the full-size renders Preview.png and ModIcon.png are cut from.
# They weigh megabytes each and the cut-down copies are what ship.
Art/

# Showcase working note: French, deleted once Preview.png and ModIcon.png exist. Ignored so it
# never reaches this public repository while it does exist.
PROMPT_*.md
